# Git repository. The public repository must NEVER track proprietary source
# (SPEC_00 decision 14: "Do not put proprietary source back into a public
# repository"). This entry keeps `firecalc-firebox-austrian-api/` out of the public working tree.
firecalc-firebox-austrian-api/